摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh-custom-plugin是一个为 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 打造的增强插件。提供：背景天气特效/玻璃拟态、时间线轨道、项目文件夹、提示词库、对话导出、Mermaid 图表渲染、引用回复、余额查询与每日 Token 用量面板等多种便利功能","id":"gh:1342948215","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-custom-plugin","slug":"AlexPeng07/dsh-custom-plugin","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh-custom-plugin是一个为 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 打造的增强插件。提供：背景天气特效/玻璃拟态、时间线轨道、项目文件夹、提示词库、对话导出、Mermaid 图表"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"渲染、引用回复、余额查询与每日 Token 用量面板等多种便利功能"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-custom-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Custom convenience suite for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web GUI: personalization, weather FX, glass "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"effects, project folders, enhanced prompts, conversation export/search, Mermaid rendering, quote rep"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ly, 7/30/90-day usage analytics, budget and key-free local backups, plus a Ctrl/Cmd+K command palett"},{"id":"p4s4","text":", 7/30/90-day usage analytics, budget and key-free local backups, plus a Ctrl/Cmd+K command palette."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The plugin is dual-face: the host half (`src/`) owns the state document, registers the `/api/custom-"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"plugin` routes and the `custom_plugin_status` agent tool; the browser half (`src/client/`) injects i"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ts UI through eight injections into seven official slots and talks to the host over same-origin fetc"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"h. Mounted through the official profile mechanism — no DSH source changes."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Selected screenshots"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Settings → 个性化: the full-page appearance config"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The same panel as a popover from the session header (light theme)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Liquid glass (displacement refraction on Custom surfaces)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Multi-level project folders"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Mermaid mindmap rendered in place"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Balance and today's per-model usage"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Rain (three depth layers)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Sakura"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Snow"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Weather FX is shown in dark mode. Usage history, backup-import previews, session search, and the com"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"mand palette are dynamic views of the same panel; open them inside DSH to inspect the live UI — no a"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"dditional fixed screenshots are included."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Appearance"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Background colors**: 20 muted low-saturation palettes (each with a matching tab color, `天青灰` by "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"default) plus \"no color\" (follows the GUI default theme). Every palette works in both themes; dark m"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ode derives the same family's dark variant (hue and low saturation kept, lightness dropped onto the "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"dark ramp), and the swatch preview shows what the current theme will actually paint.\n- **Weather FX*"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"*: canvas-rendered, pointer-transparent one-click overlays — falling snow, cinematic rain (three dep"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"th layers with splashes), and drifting sakura petals; turning it off clears the canvas.\n- **Glass**:"},{"id":"p19s7","text":" frosted glass on every Custom surface, or liquid glass (edge displacement refraction chained with a"},{"id":"p19s8","text":" slight blur + saturation so text over large panels stays readable; engines without SVG-referencing "},{"id":"p19s9","text":"backdrop filters fall back to frosted). A global-glass option extends the same treatment to dialogs,"},{"id":"p19s10","text":" menus, tooltips, listboxes and the system settings window — displaced as well in liquid mode."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Project folders"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"A multi-level folder tree persisted in the `$DSH_HOME` state file, shared across workspaces. Any wor"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"kspace or session can be folded in; folders support drag-to-reorder (before / inside / after), renam"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"e, delete, and add-current-session shortcuts."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Prompts"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"A prompt library with add / edit / copy / delete, search, favorites, tags, drag sorting, recency and"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" use counts. `{{variable}}` placeholders open a fill-in form before insertion. The library supports "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"versioned JSON and heading-based Markdown import/export."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Conversation export"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Export the current session in three formats (file names carry a date stamp):"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **JSON**: standard `messages` structure (user / assistant / tool), with a meta block carrying the "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"session title, creation time, working directory and export time — importable elsewhere;\n- **Markdown"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"**: role-sectioned plain text;\n- **PDF**: an A4 print-layout HTML opened in the browser and saved as"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" PDF; images embed as base64 (up to 30 images, 12 MB total, 4 MB each)."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Tool rows carry the tool name and an argument digest (resolved from the paired tool/call events)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Plugin state can be exported as a versioned JSON backup containing appearance, folders, prompts, sta"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"rs, usage, and budget settings. API keys and credential metadata are excluded. Imports show a confli"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ct preview, support merge or non-secret replacement, and create a recovery copy first."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Mermaid"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @alexpeng/dsh-custom-plugin\n# restart dsh web"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:AlexPeng07/dsh-custom-plugin\n# restart dsh web"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\n# build (run from this repo root)\npnpm install\npnpm build\n# add to the web profile. "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"The link path must not contain spaces: on Windows,\n# create a space-free directory junction first an"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"d link to the junction path\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:F:/dsh-plugin-dev\n# restart dsh web"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\npnpm typecheck      # type check\npnpm test           # vitest unit tests\npnpm build "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"         # build the node ESM library and the browser bundle into lib/\npnpm check:readme   # bilingu"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"al README hash consistency\npnpm smoke          # post-build contract checks: loader handshake, manif"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"est\n# fields dsh reads, patch row, local Mermaid engine,\n# real-engine Mermaid error-path DOM regres"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"sion\npnpm canary         # published plugin against the newest dsh from npm latest/next\n# (needs npm"},{"id":"p33s6","text":", bash and curl; --plugin <tgz> tests a local build)\npnpm bench:mermaid  # synthetic long-turn Merma"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"id scan/render benchmark (headless Edge)"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nbash\nmkdir -p /tmp/dshnext && cd /tmp/dshnext && npm init -y && npm i @deepseek-ai/dsh@"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"<version>\nDSH_HOME=/tmp/dshnext-home node node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/lib/bin.js plugin --profile "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"web add <packed.tgz>\nDSH_HOME=/tmp/dshnext-home node node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/lib/bin.js --prof"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"ile web --no-open --port 13999 &\nDSH_HOME=/tmp/dshnext-home DSH_PORT=13999 COOKIE_JAR=/tmp/dshnext/j"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"ar.txt bash scripts/live-dsh-check.sh"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nbash\nnode scripts/desktop-runtime.mjs \"D:/DSH\"                    # the installation di"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"r\nnode scripts/desktop-runtime.mjs \"D:/DSH/resources/app.asar\" # or the archive itself\n```"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Then run the four commands above against the version it names."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Apache-2.0. Portions of the code reference Nagi-ovo/voyager and unovue/inspira-ui."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
